-    "The FlatBars TextMate fallback — a THIN FLOOR per ADR-017. It recognises only",
-    "the bracket-delimiter shapes ({{ {{# {{/ {{^ {{< {{$ {{> {{= {{! {{!-- {{{ {{&",
-    "{{{{ {{{{# {{{{/ and their closers) and scopes the whole tag region with a",
-    "Handlebars-style meta name so themes can chip it. Inside a tag the body is",
-    "default-coloured; classifying helpers, paths, keywords, operators, strings, and",
-    "numbers is the LSP's job (it emits semantic tokens over this floor). check:vocab",
-    "asserts every vocabulary tmScope still exists in the grammar; check:tmgrammar",
-    "asserts the grammar agrees with the engine on TAG BOUNDARIES (per dialect)."
+    "FlatBars TextMate fallback \u2014 modeled on Shopify's ERB grammar shape and split",
+    "by SEMANTIC ROLE of every emitted span:",
+    "",
+    "  Every brace cluster ({{ }} / {{{ }}} / {{& / {{{{ }}}} / {{! / --}} ) is an",
+    "  ESCAPE TOKEN \u2014 it opens or closes an embedded FlatBars context. They all carry",
+    "  `punctuation.section.embedded.{begin,end}.handlebars`, so themes that paint ERB /",
+    "  PHP / Vue embedded delimiters paint FlatBars identically.",
+    "",
+    "  The SIGIL-WITH-IDENTIFIER that distinguishes control tags is captured SEPARATELY",
+    "  from the brace cluster and carries `keyword.control.*.handlebars`:",
+    "    {{#name}}  \u2192  {{  +  #name   \u2192  keyword.control.section",
+    "    {{/name}}  \u2192  {{  +  /name   \u2192  keyword.control.section",
+    "    {{^name}}  \u2192  {{  +  ^name   \u2192  keyword.control.section",
+    "    {{<name}}  \u2192  {{  +  <       \u2192  keyword.control.inheritance",
+    "    {{$name}}  \u2192  {{  +  $       \u2192  keyword.control.inheritance",
+    "    {{>name}}  \u2192  {{  +  >       \u2192  keyword.control.import",
+    "    {{=A B=}}  \u2192  {{  +  =  \u2026  =  +  }}   \u2192  keyword.directive",
+    "",
+    "Every tag region carries `meta.embedded.{line,block}.handlebars`. Inner content",
+    "(identifiers, paths, args after the sigil) is default-coloured at the floor; the",
+    "LSP corrects in-tag literals, operators, `{{else}}` / `{{elif}}` keywords, and",
+    "dialect-disallowed errors via semantic tokens (see token-vocabulary.json",
+    "`lspEmitKinds`).",
+    "",
+    "check:tmgrammar pins the engine \u2194 grammar agreement on tag boundaries per dialect.",
+    "check:vocab pins every vocabulary tmScope exists below."
   ],
